            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## First release

- Lets Teavy on iPhone and iPad use the video stream to reach this Mac from outside the local network, over one encrypted connection. Only paired devices can connect.

---

## 首个版本

- 让 iPhone、iPad 上的 Teavy 在局域网外也能经一条加密连接用视频流连这台 Mac。只有配对过的设备才能连。
]]></description>
